SUMMARY:Morning run to Sherrards Green fields and woods
DESCRIPTION:Leader: Joe de la Mata\n\nStart to the week with a fun morning 
 run by the fields and woods at Sherrards Green. I’ve walked there loads o
 f times with my dog and it’s such a nice area.\n\n5K-7K in about 1hr (ste
 ady pace). Mixed surface (tarmac - trails - tarmac) so better bring your tr
 ail trainers as it may be a bit muddy on the fields and also your head torc
 hes just in case.\n\nThe first 30min should be on tarmac and then it should
  be bright enough for running through the fields.\n\nMeet by the bus stop a
 t Madresfield road. \n\nLiRF: Joe de la Mata [Phone Number Redacted]\n\nVie
 w on Strava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3545750568814
 702096\n\nSynced from Strava Club 208705 on Fri\, 16 Oct @ 7:02 PM
