  fun morning run by the fields and woods at Sherrards Green. I’ve walked 
 there loads of times with my dog and it’s such a nice area.5K-7K in about
  1hr (steady pace). Mixed surface (tarmac - trails - tarmac) so better brin
 g your trail trainers as it may be a bit muddy on the fields and also your 
 head torches just in case.The first 30min should be on tarmac and then it s
 hould be bright enough for running through the fields.Meet by the bus stop 
 at Madresfield road. LiRF: Joe de la Mata [Phone Number Redacted]View on St
 rava: https://www.strava.com/clubs/208705/group_events/3545750568814702096S
